title: OpenBox
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

A window manager, at [[openbox.org|https://openbox.org/]]. A graphical interface at its most minimal: it draws windows you can move and resize, and nothing else. No taskbar, no file manager, no icons.

Used on [[Raspbian]] Lite in [[Pi-Top + AxiDraw = Libre Drawing Machine]].
